One thing that I noticed tinkering about in Debug mode was that
characters that died from petrification or disintegration left
corpses, which doesn't seem right.  It seems that characters that die
from petrification should leave a statue rather than a corpse, and
that characters that die from disintegration should not leave a corpse
at all (their body having been destroyed).  Perhaps this could be
included in version 3.1.

You sense the presence of spoilers.--More--

It's well documented that one cannot level teleport while holding the
Amulet.  What seems to be less well known is that potions of gain
level don't seem to be so affected.  That is, one can quaff a cursed
potion of gain level and be raised up one dungeon level even while
carrying the Amulet.  Ok, so it's not such a useful hint, but it makes
Debug mode that much easier.
			("You have 50 cursed potions of gain level.")

